{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JON","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"約拿書","commonName":"約拿書","title":"約拿書","order":32,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"d5567522b3f36e56743f9863454e9d2be7a42b5e07aa66cbef79eee85bcfaa7c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JON/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JON/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":48},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["約拿順服耶和華"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華的話二次臨到約拿說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你起來！往尼尼微大城去，向其中的居民宣告我所吩咐你的話。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["約拿便照耶和華的話起來，往尼尼微去。這尼尼微是極大的城，有三日的路程。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["約拿進城走了一日，宣告說：「再等四十日，尼尼微必傾覆了！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["尼尼微人信服上帝，便宣告禁食，從最大的到至小的都穿麻衣",{"noteId":0},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["這信息傳到尼尼微王的耳中，他就下了寶座，脫下朝服，披上麻布，坐在灰中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他又使人遍告尼尼微通城，說：「王和大臣有令，人不可嘗甚麼，牲畜、牛羊不可吃草，也不可喝水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["人與牲畜都當披上麻布；人要切切求告上帝。各人回頭離開所行的惡道，丟棄手中的強暴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["或者上帝轉意後悔，不發烈怒，使我們不致滅亡，也未可知。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["於是上帝察看他們的行為，見他們離開惡道，他就後悔，不把所說的災禍降與他們了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：披上麻布","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JON/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JON/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JON/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}